## DFD Level 0 (Context)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  %% External Entities
  U[End User (Browser)]
  QBO[Intuit QuickBooks Online]
  DRIVE[Google Drive (Optional)]

  %% MACAE as a single process
  MACAE((MACAE System))

  %% Data stores / managed services
  COSMOS[(Cosmos DB)]
  SEARCH[(Azure AI Search)]
  STORAGE[(Blob Storage)]
  AIFOUNDRY[(Azure AI Foundry / OpenAI)]
  KV[(Key Vault)]
  MON[(Azure Monitor)]

  %% Flows
  U -->|"task input, approvals"| MACAE
  MACAE -->|"UI responses, streamed status"| U

  MACAE -->|"OAuth2 + REST"| QBO
  QBO -->|"accounting data"| MACAE

  MACAE -->|"OAuth2 + REST"| DRIVE
  DRIVE -->|"documents/evidence"| MACAE

  MACAE <-->|"state, configs, tokens"| COSMOS
  MACAE <-->|"index/query"| SEARCH
  MACAE <-->|"dataset files"| STORAGE
  MACAE -->|"model/agent calls"| AIFOUNDRY
  MACAE -->|"secret references"| KV
  MACAE -->|"logs/traces/metrics"| MON
```

## DFD Level 1 (Decomposition)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  %% External Entities
  U[End User (Browser)]
  Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
  QBO[Intuit QBO]
  DRIVE[Google Drive (Optional)]

  %% Processes
  P1[1. Frontend Web App\nReact UI + /config]
  P2[2. Backend API + Orchestrator\nFastAPI + agent_framework]
  P3[3. MCP Tool Server\nFastMCP /mcp]
  P4[4. AI Foundry Agents + Models\nAI Services + Project]
  P5[5. Post-Deploy Seeding\nUpload team configs + index datasets]

  %% Data Stores / Managed Services
  D1[(Cosmos DB\nmemory + plans + tokens)]
  D2[(Azure AI Search\nindexes)]
  D3[(Blob Storage\ncontainers)]
  D4[(Key Vault\nsecrets)]
  MON[(Log Analytics + App Insights)]

  %% User interactions
  U -->|HTTPS| P1
  P1 -->|API calls + websocket| P2
  P2 -->|status streaming| P1

  %% Optional user auth
  P1 -->|OIDC/OAuth2 (TBD)| Entra
  P2 -->|JWT validation (TBD)| Entra

  %% Orchestration and tools
  P2 -->|MCP tool calls\nx-user-auth-token + Authorization| P3
  P3 -->|Finance/QBO fan-out calls\nBearer token| P2

  %% AI + data access
  P2 -->|agent/model calls (MI)| P4
  P2 <--> D1
  P2 <--> D2
  P2 <--> D3
  P2 --> D4

  %% External integrations
  P2 -->|OAuth2 + REST| QBO
  P2 -->|OAuth2 + REST| DRIVE

  %% Post-deploy scripts
  P5 -->|upload team JSON| P2
  P5 -->|read blobs| D3
  P5 -->|index docs| D2

  %% Observability
  P1 --> MON
  P2 --> MON
  P3 --> MON
  P4 --> MON
```

